1787   DAF8             ;****************************************************************************
1788   DAF8             ;* This is the main routine in charge of adding new threads to the
1789   DAF8             ;* virtual machine. The following variables are passed.
1790   DAF8             ;*
1791   DAF8             ;*  A: Pushed into VMregA
1792   DAF8             ;*  B: Pushed into VMregB
1793   DAF8             ;*  X: Thread Initial Program Counter
1794   DAF8             ;*  
1795   DAF8             ;* In addition, the following two variables contain data for the
1796   DAF8             ;* thread.
1797   DAF8             ;*  thread_priority:        Unique Identifier to classify thread
1798   DAF8             ;*  system_temp_word2:  ???
1799   DAF8             ;*
1800   DAF8             ;* See header definition file for specifics on thread class structure
