1829   DB22 A7 00                       staa    $00,X               ;|
1830   DB24 96 BB                       ldaa    temp3+1         ;|---- Set the Next pointer of the new thread to the 
1831   DB26 A7 01                       staa    $01,X               ;/     previous threads next pointer.
