4438   E8E6             ;***********************************************
4439   E8E6             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4440   E8E6             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4441   E8E6             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4442   E8E6             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
4443   E8E6             ;* fashion and calling the game ROM hook each
4444   E8E6             ;* time a credit is added to the memory location. 
4445   E8E6             ;* With this, the game ROM can control the credit 
